  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Duty of Care and Health, Safety and Security Risk Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is for NRC to continue to take all resonable steps to protect its staff from both physical and psychological harm. This is done through briefings, preparations and training while ensuring compliance with the Duty of Care principles and the Health, Safety and Security (HSS) risk management policy.</narrative>
  </description>
